{
    "title": "Sonic Dash Endless Runner Game",
    "description": "Endless runner action and 3D racing games have never been faster with Sonic Dash! Enjoy a fun race & run through each level and feel the speed as you navigate 3D runner race courses with Sonic the Hedgehog, Knuckles, Tails, Shadow, and more. Collect rings and race past challenging obstacles in this fast running game by SEGA! Sonic Dash is a fun run experience with a casual take on racing games for kids and adults alike.\r\n\r\nEnjoy running games with a Sonic twist! Run, race, and jump fast with Sonic and friends. This exciting endless running game brings you a blazing fast fun race experience with easy to use controls to help you dominate each 3D race course. Collect rings, spin dash through badniks, and battle Dr. Eggman in epic boss battles in a 3D runner filled with obstacles from the Sonic universe!\r\n\r\nCollect character cards and unlock your favorite Sonic characters! Put your racing, running, and jumping capabilities to the test. Play as Knuckles, Tails, Amy, and more in endless running games with a fast-paced 3D racing experience only the Sonic universe can deliver. If you\u2019re a fan of Original, Classic Sonic and Classic SEGA racing games, you\u2019ll love Sonic Dash!\r\n\r\nEndless running games have never looked better! Sonic Dash combines endless runner gameplay with the iconic Sonic universe! Run on a 3D race track featuring inspired designs from classic Sonic levels such as Green Hill Zone with its loop de loops and corkscrews! Check out new levels such as the Beach Zone and run through the sand or take to the skies in the Sky Sanctuary Zone!\r\n\r\nExperience a fun race and an endless runner like no other! Run and race with Sonic & friends, collect rings, level up, and earn rewards today! Experience speed the Sonic way in this spectacular 3D runner race game! Download today!\r\n\r\nSONIC DASH FEATURES\r\n\r\nEPIC ENDLESS RUNNER WITH SONIC\r\n- Race & dash into an endless running game like no other\r\n- Casual fun run experience or record breaking racing challenge? It\u2019s up to you!\r\n- Spin dash badniks, collect rings, & earn rewards!\r\n- Run with easy to use 3D race controls\r\n\r\nCOLLECT & RACE WITH YOUR FAVORITE SONIC CHARACTERS\r\n- Sonic, Shadow, Tails, Knuckles, and many more await the next fun run\r\n- Start up your next endless running game with your favorite Sonic character\r\n- This 3D Runner race will take you on a speedy adventure alongside Sonic and beloved characters\r\n\r\nRUNNING GAMES & 3D RACING HAVE NEVER LOOKED SO GOOD\r\n- Endless runner gameplay within the iconic Sonic Universe\r\n- Run, race, dash, & jump through Green Hill Zone, Beach Zone, and more\r\n- Enjoy a fun run upside down on loop de loops, on a corkscrew, or underwater\r\n\r\nEPIC 3D RUNNER BOSS BATTLES\r\n- Run fast & take on bosses like Dr. Eggman and Zazz\r\n- Jump & dodge their attacks & finish them with a spin dash attack\r\n- Collect & earn big points and rewards\r\n\r\nMORE THAN JUST AN ENDLESS RUNNER\r\n- Customize your endless running game outside of the course\r\n- Complete a fun race, save animal friends, and explore the entire Sonic universe\r\n- Customize your very own zone in a fun run experience that goes beyond the track\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: http://www.sega.com/mprivacy/\r\nTerms of Use: http://www.sega.com/Mobile_EULA\r\n\r\nSEGA\u2019s Sonic Dash is ad-supported and in-app purchases are not required to progress. Ad-free play is available with an in-app purchase.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Endless runner action and 3D racing games have never been faster with Sonic Dash! Enjoy a fun race &amp; run through each level and feel the speed as you navigate 3D runner race courses with Sonic the Hedgehog, Knuckles, Tails, Shadow, and more. Collect rings and race past challenging obstacles in this fast running game by SEGA! Sonic Dash is a fun run experience with a casual take on racing games for kids and adults alike.<br><br>Enjoy running games with a Sonic twist! Run, race, and jump fast with Sonic and friends. This exciting endless running game brings you a blazing fast fun race experience with easy to use controls to help you dominate each 3D race course. Collect rings, spin dash through badniks, and battle Dr. Eggman in epic boss battles in a 3D runner filled with obstacles from the Sonic universe!<br><br>Collect character cards and unlock your favorite Sonic characters! Put your racing, running, and jumping capabilities to the test. Play as Knuckles, Tails, Amy, and more in endless running games with a fast-paced 3D racing experience only the Sonic universe can deliver. If you\u2019re a fan of Original, Classic Sonic and Classic SEGA racing games, you\u2019ll love Sonic Dash!<br><br>Endless running games have never looked better! Sonic Dash combines endless runner gameplay with the iconic Sonic universe! Run on a 3D race track featuring inspired designs from classic Sonic levels such as Green Hill Zone with its loop de loops and corkscrews! Check out new levels such as the Beach Zone and run through the sand or take to the skies in the Sky Sanctuary Zone!<br><br>Experience a fun race and an endless runner like no other! Run and race with Sonic &amp; friends, collect rings, level up, and earn rewards today! Experience speed the Sonic way in this spectacular 3D runner race game! Download today!<br><br>SONIC DASH FEATURES<br><br>EPIC ENDLESS RUNNER WITH SONIC<br>- Race &amp; dash into an endless running game like no other<br>- Casual fun run experience or record breaking racing challenge? It\u2019s up to you!<br>- Spin dash badniks, collect rings, &amp; earn rewards!<br>- Run with easy to use 3D race controls<br><br>COLLECT &amp; RACE WITH YOUR FAVORITE SONIC CHARACTERS<br>- Sonic, Shadow, Tails, Knuckles, and many more await the next fun run<br>- Start up your next endless running game with your favorite Sonic character<br>- This 3D Runner race will take you on a speedy adventure alongside Sonic and beloved characters<br><br>RUNNING GAMES &amp; 3D RACING HAVE NEVER LOOKED SO GOOD<br>- Endless runner gameplay within the iconic Sonic Universe<br>- Run, race, dash, &amp; jump through Green Hill Zone, Beach Zone, and more<br>- Enjoy a fun run upside down on loop de loops, on a corkscrew, or underwater<br><br>EPIC 3D RUNNER BOSS BATTLES<br>- Run fast &amp; take on bosses like Dr. Eggman and Zazz<br>- Jump &amp; dodge their attacks &amp; finish them with a spin dash attack<br>- Collect &amp; earn big points and rewards<br><br>MORE THAN JUST AN ENDLESS RUNNER<br>- Customize your endless running game outside of the course<br>- Complete a fun race, save animal friends, and explore the entire Sonic universe<br>- Customize your very own zone in a fun run experience that goes beyond the track<br><br>Privacy Policy: http://www.sega.com/mprivacy/<br>Terms of Use: http://www.sega.com/Mobile_EULA<br><br>SEGA\u2019s Sonic Dash is ad-supported and in-app purchases are not required to progress. Ad-free play is available with an in-app purchase.",
